{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meganoid: Chronicles is a classic brutal platform game where you will not escape death! You will need to bring your best game skills to complete the short but challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenging level can be completed within a few seconds, making the pace of the game pretty fast, but the difficulty level ramps up swiftly and completing a level on the first try will be a rare event</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meganoid: Chronicles tells the story of the Meganoid family tree going all the way back to Grandpa's time and is a throw back to the age of tomb raiding and lost civilizations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging platform action in short bite size levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful pixel-art retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hundred levels in normal mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure in every level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing chiptune sound track</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Toota temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875330/433f02d7e8de84116a056391fd8c6ad2d4d3e10d.jpg"},{"name":"Secret passage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875330/c540df087a6f9a6d321faa5a3240f30efa02120f.jpg"},{"name":"Lost city","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875330/e3209b8f2600285f79996e3c979c26453c274b93.jpg"},{"name":"Inca temple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875330/bec3f82e272dee44312ee250d2747852c64dc5fc.jpg"},{"name":"Dangerous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3875330/c49b57d2c6f8cd33a6679d56653f7f7da3f65ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Himalaya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/publi